      "general": {
        "abstract": "The Oueme mesoscale site (Benin) is part of the AMMA-CATCH observation network. Its characteristics are as follows a 14000 km² basin in sudanian climate on a crystaline basement. The studies focus on the hydrological cycle, the water budget and the hydrological processes.\r\n",
        "citation": "AMMA-CATCH (1996): AMMA-CATCH observatory: upper Oueme mesoscale site (14 000 km2) in the sudanian climate zone, Benin. IRD, CNRS-INSU, OSUG, OMP, OREME. doi:10.17178/AMMA-CATCH.benin",
        "relatedIdentifiers": [
